              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "పాత్ర — pātra — \"a character (in a story); a role\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆ నాటకంలో నాది చిన్న పాత్ర. ā nāṭakaṁlō nādi cinna pātra. I have a small part in that play."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: పాత్రలు, pātralu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a vessel or a pot: the Sanskrit word meant a vessel first."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "పాత్ర (pātra) is borrowed from Sanskrit pātra, \"a drinking vessel, a dish\" (CDIAL 8055); in Telugu it is also a part in a play."
